Intel XPU Manager (XPUM) C API headers vendored for monitor builds.

The monitor compiles `intel_gpu` against these headers only — never system
`/usr/include`. At runtime `libxpum` is dlopen'd (`xpum_gpu_dyn.c`); override
with `HPCPERFSTATS_XPUM_LIB`.

Source: https://github.com/intel/xpumanager
Pinned tag: V1.2.33 (matches Stampede3 `xpumanager-1.2.33` RPM)

Files:
  xpum_api.h
  xpum_structs.h

License: MIT (see SPDX headers in each file).
